# Ops owns infrastructure. The frontend engineer co-owns the dashboard and
# docs contracts because the dashboards are consumed by the platform team.
#
# These are individual handles, deliberately: the GitHub team slugs do not
# exist until Task 12 creates them, and a placeholder-shaped `@romeufcrosa/...`
# is a valid-looking line that routes every review to nobody. Task 12 replaces
# each handle with the corresponding team slug in the same commit that creates
# the team.
/tofu/            @romeurosa
/kubernetes/      @romeurosa
/argocd/          @romeurosa
/scripts/         @romeurosa
/helm/            @romeurosa
/dashboards/      @romeurosa
/docs/            @romeurosa
